            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Black Screen",
            "text": "#在{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}听起来像是鼓励的「呀！呀！」声中，胆小的绵驮兽沿着刚才搭好的木板爬了上来…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750101603"
            ]
          },
          "750101603": {
            "id": "750101603",
            "speakerId": 21490,
            "speakerName": "胆小的绵驮兽",
            "text": "嗯…嗯——",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750101604"
            ]
          },
          "750101604": {
            "id": "750101604",
            "speakerId": 14662,
            "speakerName": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}",
            "text": "唔？呀！呀呀！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750101605"
            ]
          },
          "750101605": {
            "id": "750101605",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Black Screen",
            "text": "#面对热情的{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}，看起来十分胆小的绵驮兽没有表现出害怕的样子，反而是弯下身子用鼻尖轻轻碰了碰{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750101606"
            ]
          },
          "750101606": {
            "id": "750101606",
            "speakerId": 14662,
            "speakerName": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}",
            "text": "呜…呀！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750101607"
            ]
          },
          "750101607": {
            "id": "750101607",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "嘿嘿，这样算是表示感情不错吧？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750101609",
              "750101611"
            ]
          },
          "750101609": {
            "id": "750101609",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "也是我的朋友！不对不对，你这是在和谁较劲啦。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750101612"
            ]
          },
          "750101612": {
            "id": "750101612",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "不过它独自在这边还是有点危险吧？还是和瓦达娜讲一下这件事好了。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750101613"
            ]
          },
          "750101613": {
            "id": "750101613",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "#她要是知道{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}交上绵驮兽朋友了，肯定也会替{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}高兴的！"
          },
          "750101611": {
            "id": "750101611",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "嗯？一时之间居然不知道你羡慕的究竟是哪边！"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7501012",
      "subQuestName": "向瓦达娜回报",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "750101201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "750101201": {
            "id": "750101201",
            "speakerId": 21487,
            "speakerName": "瓦达娜",
            "text": "你回来啦小家伙，怎么样，交到绵驮兽朋友了吗？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750101202"
            ]
          },
          "750101202": {
            "id": "750101202",
            "speakerId": 14662,
            "speakerName": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}",
            "text": "呀！呀呀！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750101203"
            ]
          },
          "750101203": {
            "id": "750101203",
            "speakerId": 21487,
            "speakerName": "瓦达娜",
            "text": "嗯嗯，看你高兴的样子，我也跟着高兴起来了，真好！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750101204"
            ]
          },
          "750101204": {
            "id": "750101204",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "#瓦达娜也该多关心一下绵驮兽啦，和{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}交上朋友的那只绵驮兽刚才在好危险的地方呢。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750101205"
            ]
          },
          "750101205": {
            "id": "750101205",
            "speakerId": 21487,
            "speakerName": "瓦达娜",
            "text": "哎呀，是这样吗？得告诉「半熟蛋」，让它以后多注意一下才行。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750101207",
              "750101209"
            ]
          },
          "750101207": {
            "id": "750101207",
            "speakerId": 21487,
            "speakerName": "瓦达娜",
            "text": "是啊，我已经过上了理想的生活，恭喜我吧！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750101211"
            ]
          },
          "750101211": {
            "id": "750101211",
            "speakerId": 21487,
            "speakerName": "瓦达娜",
            "text": "#对了，旁边的绵驮兽玩具，{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}要是喜欢就送给你们好啦。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750101212"
            ]
          },
          "750101212": {
            "id": "750101212",
            "speakerId": 14662,
            "speakerName": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}",
            "text": "呀呀！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750101213"
            ]
          },
          "750101213": {
            "id": "750101213",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}还真是不客气啊。那就谢谢瓦达娜了！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750101214"
            ]
          },
          "750101214": {
            "id": "750101214",
            "speakerId": 21487,
            "speakerName": "瓦达娜",
            "text": "小事小事，也欢迎你们常来玩呀。"
          },
          "750101209": {
            "id": "750101209",
            "speakerId": 21487,
            "speakerName": "瓦达娜",
            "text": "辛苦是辛苦…不过它生性就爱操心，你要是不让它看管这些绵驮兽，它反而会焦虑到掉毛呢。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750101210"
            ]
          },
          "750101210": {
            "id": "750101210",
            "speakerId": 21487,
            "speakerName": "瓦达娜",
            "text": "所以现在这样是最好的，它完成了工作会很满足，我也乐得轻松自在，很不错吧？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
